sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Frontend
  participant API as Backend + Fabric adapter
  participant CC as Chaincode
  participant DB as Mongo projection

  UI->>API: GET /api/wallet
  API->>CC: ReadWalletByOwner via Gateway
  alt Wallet does not exist
    API->>CC: CreateUser if needed
    API->>CC: CreateWallet(walletId, owner)
    API->>CC: Reread wallet
  end
  CC-->>API: Validated wallet result
  API->>DB: Persist
  API-->>UI: Return balanceTokens (available)

  UI->>API: POST /api/wallet/issue-tokens
  Note right of API: Authenticate caller and apply server-side issuance policy
  API->>CC: IssueTokens(walletId, authorized amount, reference)
  Note right of CC: Chaincode verifies issuer authorization
  CC-->>API: Validated issuance receipt
  API->>DB: Persist
  API-->>UI: Updated balance
